OL,3,GNEWSAWarning over fake social media
OL,4,Ashopping deals
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have issued a warning about a
OL,7,Fscam where organised crime groups offer
OL,8,Ffake heavily discounted deals from
OL,9,Fretail providers on social media.
OL,11,FDerbyshire Police's cyber crime team
OL,12,Ftold the BBC there have been 30
OL,13,Finstances in the county this year of
OL,14,Fpeople handing over money to what they
OL,15,Fthought were supermarkets, electronic
OL,16,Fand catalogue retailers.
OL,18,FOfficers said it was a "new tactic"
OL,19,Ffrom scammers to obtain bank details by
OL,20,Foffering deals ranging from 40% to 70%
OL,21,Foff items and services.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
